  "description": "Sweetgrass Botanicals Amplify 1350mg CBD/CBG/THC Tincture delivers a powerful trio of cannabinoids in one convenient bottle. This premium tincture combines 1350mg of CBD, CBG, and THC to create a balanced, full-spectrum experience designed to amplify wellness and relief. The carefully crafted formula harnesses the entourage effect, allowing each cannabinoid to work synergistically for enhanced benefits. Perfect for those seeking relaxed, focused, and uplifted effects, this tincture offers versatile dosing with its easy-to-use dropper. Whether you're looking for relief from discomfort, support for stress management, or simply want to enhance your daily wellness routine, Amplify provides consistent, reliable results. The clean, earthy flavor profile makes it easy to incorporate into your day, taken directly or added to your favorite beverage. Sweetgrass Botanicals ensures quality and potency in every drop.",
